:: Arcade Crane 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>

<<if $hour isnot 8>>
	<<if $phase is 0>>
		Arcade soon closes down leaving you with no hope of anyone noticing you for a long time.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Try to free yourself (0:30)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 30>><</link>><<gpain>><<gtiredness>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Sleep (8:00)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $phase is 1>>
		You try to free yourself.
		<<tiredness 2>><<physique 1>><<pain 2>>
		<<if $rng gte 99 - ($physique/1000)>>/* means -16 at most */
			You manage to break your bindings, there is hatch you could open and use to crawl out of the crane machine. 
			<br>
			The bed of plushies is pretty soft, you could sleep on it. <<if $hour lte 5 or $hour gte 21>> Considering how late it is <<if $exposed gte 2>>and how naked you are <</if>>it might be safer than wandering outside.<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Leave|Arcade]]>><<endevent "ArcPO1" 2>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Sleep (8:00)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			You fail.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Try to free yourself (0:30)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 30>><</link>><<gpain>><<gtiredness>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Sleep|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $phase is 2 or $phase is 3>>
		<<if $hour gt 10 or $hour + 8 lt 8>>
			/*<<pass 8 "h">>*/
			<<set $sleephour to 8>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $sleephour to 8-$hour>>
			<<set $phase to 5>>
		<</if>>
		<<sleep>>
		<<if $nightmares gte 1 and $controlled is 0>>
			You dream you are being hunted by a scary plushy.
		<<else>>
			You sleep soundly among the plushies.
		<</if>>
		<<sleepeffects>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $phase is 5>>
			Your sleep is interrupted by someone lifting you and bringing you to brightness but soon the darkness returns and you drift back to sleep despite the now harder bed below you.
			<<link [[Next|Trash Intro]]>><<endevent "ArcPO1" 3>><</link>>
		<<elseif $phase is 2>>
			<<link [[Try to free yourself (0:30)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 30>><</link>><<gpain>><<gtiredness>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Sleep(8:00)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
		<<else>>
			You wake from your sleep to a still dark arcade. But the bed of plushies is pretty soft and considering how late it is sleeping here until morning might be a safer than wandering outside naked.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Leave|Arcade]]>><</link>>
			<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<set $phase to 4>><<pass 1 "h">><</link>>
		<</if>>
		
	<<elseif $phase is 4>>
		You wait for a while.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Leave|Arcade]]>><</link>>
		<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Arcade Crane 3]]>><<pass 1 "h">><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	Lights are turned on and after a while a <<person>> walks into view. <<He>> gapes at the sight of you. Snapping to attention, <<he>> crouches beside the machine. A hatch opens after a few moments of <<his>> fiddling. <<if $phase lte 2>><<He>> reaches in, and unties the cables that bind you.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	You crawl through the hole, escaping into the arcade proper.
		<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		Blushing, <<he>> wraps some towels around you. "Not much, but better than nothing aye?"<<towelup>>
		<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"How the heck did you end up in there?" <<he>> says, shaking <<his>> head. "No matter, I need to open this place up in a bit so off you go." He leads you out of the building.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent "ArcPO1" 1>>
	<<link [[Next|Starfish Street]]>><</link>>
	
<</if>>

:: Arcade Trash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "arcade">><<effects>>

You awaken on something hard and bumpy. Just in time to see a door slam shut above you, plunging you into darkness. You drift back into unconsciousness.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Trash Intro]]>><</link>>
